Question. 13 Write a query to display department name, name (first_name, last_name), hire date, salary of the manager for all managers whose experience is more than 15 years.

SELECT 
    d.department_name, 
    e.first_name, 
    e.last_name, 
    e.hire_date, 
    e.salary 
FROM departments d 
JOIN employees e 
    ON d.manager_id = e.employee_id 
WHERE TIMESTAMPDIFF(YEAR, e.hire_date, CURDATE()) > 15;
